## 3. Supabase PostgreSQL Tables

| Table | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `archived_deliveries` | All deliveries moved out of Firestore after daily reset. Primary key = `id` (Firestore doc ID). Unique constraint prevents duplicate inserts. |
| `daily_summary` | One row per calendar day: `total_deliveries, delivered, delayed, pending, completion_rate, archived_at`. Unique constraint on `archive_date`. |

### Supabase Schema (archived_deliveries)
```sql
id               TEXT PRIMARY KEY,
archive_date     DATE NOT NULL,
customer_id      TEXT,
customer_name    TEXT,
customer_phone   TEXT,
box_id           TEXT,
pickup_location  TEXT,
delivery_address TEXT,
assigned_to      TEXT,
assigned_name    TEXT,
agent_phone      TEXT,
status           TEXT,
was_delayed      BOOLEAN,
pickup_order     INT,
item_count       INT,
notes            TEXT,
delivery_date    DATE,
picked_at        BIGINT,
timestamp        BIGINT,
archived_at      BIGINT
```

