## 7. Customer Limits & Scaling

| Parameter | Limit | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Max customers in master list | No code limit | Stored in `customers` collection |
| UI renders all at once | Works well up to ~2,000 | No virtualization — plain DOM table |
| Auto-assign reads all active customers | 1 `get()` call | For 1,000 customers = 1,000 reads on one assign click |
| Daily delivery creation | Batch writes (490 ops/batch) | Handles unlimited — batches auto-split |

**Current practical comfortable range:** 50–500 active customers.

