## 8. Daily Operations Flow (Step-by-Step)

```
Morning:
1. Admin logs in → loadAgents() + listenDeliveries() fire
2. Admin clicks "Assign Today's Routes"
   → Reads customers collection (1 get)
   → Batches delivery docs into Firestore (N writes)
   → Agents see routes on Android app instantly via onSnapshot

During Delivery (10:30 AM – 1:00 PM):
3. Each agent status update → 1 Firestore write
4. Admin dashboard updates in real-time (onSnapshot fires)
5. Agent Load card + Schools Today card update instantly (no new reads)
6. Agent card stats update instantly (no new reads — from allDeliveries in memory)

Evening:
7. Admin clicks "Archive & Reset"
   → archiveDeliveries(true) collects all delivery docs
   → POST to /.netlify/functions/sync-history → Supabase transaction
   → On success: batch delete from Firestore
   → analyticsLoaded = false (forces re-fetch from Supabase next visit)
```

