## 9. History & Analytics Data Flow

```
DAILY RESET:
  Firestore deliveries → [Netlify sync-history.js] → Supabase archived_deliveries

ANALYTICS VIEW (Analytics Tab):
  Supabase archived_deliveries (paginated, 1000 rows/page) +
  Firestore deliveries (today's live) +
  Firestore customers (master list)
  → Merged in memory → Rendered

HISTORY TAB (single day lookup):
  Supabase archived_deliveries filtered by archive_date
  (falls back to Firestore history/{date}/deliveries for pre-migration dates)
```

