## 13. Known Limitations & Watchpoints

> [!WARNING]
> **Supabase Free Tier pauses** after 7 days of inactivity. If the admin doesn't visit for a week, the Supabase project may pause and history/analytics will fail until manually unpaused. Upgrade to Supabase Pro ($25/mo) to prevent this.

> [!NOTE]
> **`deliveryAddress` is the school name field.** There is no separate `schoolName` field in Firestore. The `renderSchoolLoad()` function reads `deliveryAddress` and normalizes it. If an address is entered inconsistently (e.g., a house address), it will appear as a school card. Ensure all deliveries use school names as the delivery address.

> [!NOTE]
> **Firebase Analytics / FCM not used.** Agent push notifications are prepared (`fcmToken` is stored) but push sending is not currently wired up in the admin panel.

> [!TIP]
> **The delivery hours guard (10:30 AM – 1:00 PM)** in both `triggerReset()` and `runAssign()` protects against accidental resets mid-delivery. It prompts an extra warning but does NOT block the action — admin can still proceed.

